Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 17:47:01 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] fix(a5): require exact NAND firmware, full geometry, and zero
 builder fallback

- Require exact NAND firmware identity and full physical geometry matching in nand_diagnose.py
- Reject all missing or mismatched blocks, page counts, row-address bits and CE information
- Add regression tests in test_lwvm_dynamic.py reproducing all three false-positive readiness cases
- Remove diagnostic builder candidate fallback in make-diag-kernelcache.sh; require synchronized zImage, vmlinux, and kernel-config from the same build
- Reconcile diagnostic image hashes and test telemetry in documentation
